`journalVersion` 3. The `headerIsV3` check is in the same path. The `JournalEventSchema` union includes only the v1/v2 `run-started` and `run-finished` members and the reservation events. It has no v3 members.\n\nKeep the append path on `JournalEventV1V2Schema`. It correctly rejects v3 records for now.\n\nWiring the v3 carriers into the reader union needs a design choice. The union is a `discriminatedUnion` keyed on `type`. The v3 `run-started` shares `type: 'run-started'` with the v1/v2 `run-started`. Choose a construct that accepts both shapes, then confirm it parses each one.","id":"bee97c7202abb132072955e7e4f687ad2f8a120775feff4d3b4f0c759f608647","intervals":[],"path":"src/kernel/schema.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Add the v3 carriers to the reader's `JournalEventSchema`."}],"head":"bc26530ef58e7ab1871c13c4079b3d2cc54d1eeb","head_tree":"cc75c7885aeaf67b986983f1d5626715530dd317","input_scope":[{"blob":"b1cdb9eb0be3f9fd39314f8dc3e1f254472b6864","intervals":[[26,26],[28,36],[42,42],[45,45],[47,47],[52,70],[74,79],[82,99],[122,195],[209,214],[216,223],[225,231],[233,255],[257,271],[273,322],[325,337],[339,347],[349,359],[387,446],[448,458],[460,501],[503,594],[614,1003],[1009,1014]],"path":"src/kernel/schema.ts"},{"blob":"73357cb503505e230b68cfc6d85b01f27b83659e","intervals":[[11,34],[43,45],[50,51],[73,74],[78,81],[87,87],[92,116]],"path":"src/ops/review/index.ts"}],"job_id":"c78e167e434b7886e1108f73bc5c57b48efb31486bdfbd8bd82e24a78a862945:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"entry":{"blob":"e83a8200811d37f3c95e2ea3b9ab9b5d04bccf09","kind":"blob","mode":"100644","path":"src/kernel/schema.ts"},"merge":"6a842e1e1bf6ffde44dd9d8f561a01d702b4bb34","method":"pre-merge","pre":"5170bdc4c98ac6712fb87c0109c31445488629f1","source_path":"src/kernel/schema.ts"},"blob":"b1cdb9eb0be3f9fd39314f8dc3e1f254472b6864","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/kernel/schema.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":